clearcote r11 -- WebGL/persona parity.

Advertised extension set == gettable set in both directions (WEBGL_debug_renderer_info
always exempt), MAX_ELEMENT_INDEX served from the persona unclamped, persona uniform-block
default 14 -> 12, and the WebGPU adapter follows --disable-gpu-fingerprint.

Tail patch: every file below is already touched by 002/070/071/142/170, so these hunks are
expressed against the fully-applied stack rather than folded into those patches.

--- a/third_party/blink/renderer/modules/webgl/webgl_rendering_context_base.cc
